{"id":"37e8c28d922b32f1","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-proof-theory-truth.md","title":"真理证明论","display":"df-proof-theory-truth — 真理证明论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-proof-theory-truth","aliases":["91-df-proof-theory-truth","91-df-truth-proof-theory","91-df-provability-in-truth"],"display":"df-proof-theory-truth — 真理证明论","depends_on":["[[91-df-ordinal-analysis]]","[[91-df-truth-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-proof-theory-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-proof-theory-truth</span><span>91-df-truth-proof-theory</span><span>91-df-provability-in-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-theory-truth — 真理证明论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99cc98508e51c9ee\" href=\"?note=99cc98508e51c9ee\" title=\"91-df-ordinal-analysis\">91-df-ordinal-analysis</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-proof-theory-truth-—-真理证明论-$\\mathrm{PTTruth}$\">df-proof-theory-truth — 真理证明论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PTTruth}\">\\(\\mathrm{PTTruth}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{T}_T\\)</span> (真理理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> (共同语言后果类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(O,\\prec)\">\\((O,\\prec)\\)</span> (有效序数记法系统)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_T)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>-后果集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal T_T|_O\">\\(|\\mathcal T_T|_O\\)</span> (相对记法系统的证明论序数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> (用于归约或解释的目标理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}_{\\mathcal B}\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{Proof}(\\mathcal T_T)\\times\\operatorname{Proof}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}_{\\mathcal B}\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{Proof}(\\mathcal T_T)\\times\\operatorname{Proof}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span>\n(已指定的证明归约或解释关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}theory\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PTTruth}(\\mathcal T_T;\\mathcal C,O,\\mathcal B)\n\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_T),\n\\operatorname{Red}_{\\mathcal B},\n|\\mathcal T_T|_O\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}theory\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PTTruth}(\\mathcal T_T;\\mathcal C,O,\\mathcal B)\n\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_T),\n\\operatorname{Red}_{\\mathcal B},\n|\\mathcal T_T|_O\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PTTruth}\">\\(\\mathrm{PTTruth}\\)</span> : 真理理论的证明论方法</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha)\\)</span> : 序数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>上的超限归纳原则</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal{T}_T|\">\\(|\\mathcal{T}_T|\\)</span> : 理论的证明论序数</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真理证明论研究真理公理对可证后果、证明变换、相对解释和序数强度的影响。序数分析是其中一种工具，不是全部内容。</p>\n<p>各真理理论的序数分析：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th>序数</th>\n<th>分析方法</th>\n<th>预测性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>PA</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span></td>\n<td>Gentzen分析</td>\n<td>predicative</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TB/UTB</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span></td>\n<td>继承PA</td>\n<td>predicative</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span></td>\n<td>与 PA 同算术强度</td>\n<td>保守性/可行归约</td>\n<td>不由此直接分类预测性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>所有有限层迭代真理</td>\n<td>分层真理解释</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td>所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 层分层真理</td>\n<td>Feferman 分析</td>\n<td>原文的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 赋值不正确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VF</td>\n<td>强度显著高于 KF 的标准超赋值理论</td>\n<td>需独立分析</td>\n<td>不能写成“等价 KF”</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>证明论分析的技术：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Gentzen方法</td>\n<td>截消定理 + 序数记法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feferman方法</td>\n<td>系统化序数分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Takeuti方法</td>\n<td>证明图分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>序数分析的步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>构造序数记法系统</li>\n<li>嵌入证明到序数</li>\n<li>证明归纳可终止</li>\n<li>证明所得上、下界相合</li>\n</ol>\n<p>证明论与真理的关系：\n序数比较只有在采用兼容记法、共同基准和已证明对应时才支持强度比较；它不直接度量“处理真理”的哲学能力。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 是传统预测性分析的一个基准，但 KF 的标准校准是分层真理至 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 以下各层，不能把二者混写。</p>\n<p>定义的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理解真理理论的证明论度量</li>\n<li>区分预测性与非预测性理论</li>\n<li>分析序数分析的技术应用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-proof-theory-truth-—-真理证明论-$\\mathrm{PTTruth}$","text":"df-proof-theory-truth — 真理证明论 $\\mathrm{PTTruth}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ordinal-analysis","status":"resolved","id":"99cc98508e51c9ee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ordinal-analysis]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PTTruth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{T}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"(O,\\prec)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathcal T_T|_O","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Red}_{\\mathcal B}\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{Proof}(\\mathcal T_T)\\times\\operatorname{Proof}(\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}theory\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PTTruth}(\\mathcal T_T;\\mathcal C,O,\\mathcal B)\n\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_T),\n\\operatorname{Red}_{\\mathcal B},\n|\\mathcal T_T|_O\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PTTruth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathcal{T}_T|","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"^-","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false}],"byte